# SPA fallback for the only client-only routes: category filters /projects/<tag>.
# All real pages (/, /home, /projects, /resume, /projects/<slug>) are prerendered
# to static files and served directly with 200, so this only catches non-file paths.
#
# Destination is "/" (NOT "/index.html"): Cloudflare's loop detector rejects any
# rewrite whose target it can strip ".html"/"/index" from — it ignored both
# "/*  /index.html  200" and "/projects/*  /index.html  200". "/" has nothing to
# strip, so it parses cleanly while still serving the app shell (index.html).
/projects/*  /  200
